{"chapter": "algebraic", "node_kind": "paragraph", "parent_tag": "04T3", "placeholders": {"REF_0001": "\\ref{lemma-stack-presentation}", "STRUCT_0001": "\\noindent"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R2", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:9e56be69ed15a99701727fbb07022ece89eb990e2acd417da538adfa202db0fe", "source_text": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\nLemma <REF_0001>\nsuggests the following definitions.\n\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:583e5d0898dec88006ed4828ba57a00f2e297996ae7217848eae68dc11b3cb2a", "unit_id": "tag:04T3:prose-0003"}
{"chapter": "algebraic", "node_kind": "definition", "parent_tag": "04T3", "placeholders": {"FOOTNOTECLOSE_0001": "}", "FOOTNOTEOPEN_0001": "\\footnote{", "MATH_0001": "$S$", "MATH_0002": "$B$", "MATH_0003": "$S$", "MATH_0004": "$(U, R, s, t, c)$", "MATH_0005": "$B$", "MATH_0006": "$(U, R, s, t, c)$", "MATH_0007": "$[U/R]$", "MATH_0008": "$s, t : R \\to U$", "TEXTITCLOSE_0001": "}", "TEXTITOPEN_0001": "{\\it "}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{definition}\n\\label{definition-smooth-groupoid}\n", "suffix": "\\end{definition}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:da6a61df459066c968c3cf0ade3ae8b5722a0cef0e8bba156e68e2d07ce29045", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:f03db4f7f0ffcc3295009ac0a15700570496d31226a19e4c7f84fd4cd20237fa", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a scheme. Let <MATH_0002> be an algebraic space over <MATH_0003>.\nLet <MATH_0004> be a groupoid in algebraic spaces over <MATH_0005>.\nWe say <MATH_0006> is a <TEXTITOPEN_0001>smooth groupoid<TEXTITCLOSE_0001><FOOTNOTEOPEN_0001>This terminology\nmight be a bit confusing: it does not imply that <MATH_0007> is smooth\nover anything.<FOOTNOTECLOSE_0001>\nif <MATH_0008> are smooth morphisms of algebraic spaces.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:57a321448d255649b0a1e1aae06d5aca91f73c9ece7adeef3c69f30519f2be05", "unit_id": "tag:04TH:statement"}
{"chapter": "algebraic", "node_kind": "definition", "parent_tag": "04T3", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$\\mathcal{X}$", "MATH_0002": "$S$", "MATH_0003": "$\\mathcal{X}$", "MATH_0004": "$(U, R, s, t, c)$", "MATH_0005": "$S$", "MATH_0006": "$f : [U/R] \\to \\mathcal{X}$", "TEXTITCLOSE_0001": "}", "TEXTITOPEN_0001": "{\\it "}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{definition}\n\\label{definition-presentation}\n", "suffix": "\\end{definition}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:6f4d948bdcefe78c25b6058ea05aca7e56ee1c792c414f7c9c0346eaaeb0a13a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:57814e55609c814d4721cde4878995c7066f51ac0a92722f7637993420810a09", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be an algebraic stack over <MATH_0002>.\nA <TEXTITOPEN_0001>presentation<TEXTITCLOSE_0001> of <MATH_0003> is given by a smooth groupoid\n<MATH_0004> in algebraic spaces over <MATH_0005>, and an\nequivalence <MATH_0006>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:dfaa2c9c66851459ea04249bd3cb9e546318e1fbae36f40aa7c24e108bb85ecf", "unit_id": "tag:04TI:statement"}
{"chapter": "algebraic", "node_kind": "paragraph", "parent_tag": "04T3", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$S$", "STRUCT_0001": "\\noindent"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R2", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:86ec2eecd570d0c8a4f479624baf284069e51967c1f2fc353abd21054aea9915", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:3e24003eed1c012975141b4a836f314b2c568c7f494e5e3180a296d5b9d17859", "source_text": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\nWe have seen above that every algebraic stack has a presentation.\nOur next task is to show that every smooth groupoid in algebraic\nspaces over <MATH_0001> gives rise to an algebraic stack.\n\n\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:4cd8ddf737a97b56cb3d195f710aefd0ec9dffe51a13825a5ced3c57dab8a366", "unit_id": "tag:04T3:prose-0004"}
